    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't remember how you were transported here, but this was your world now, your restaurant in another world, <strong>Isekai-ya</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dreams to become a chef took a strange turn, reality seemed to have warped before your eyes and what you see before you just seemed so odd. The buzz of unfamiliar languages, yet weirdly comprehensible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People of all shapes, colour and sizes; pointy ears and even fluffy warmth..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, in front of you, were unmistakably: A kitchen countertop, stoves, and shelves and larders stocked with colorful ingredients.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visit different worlds, meet the unique inhabitants</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who would you meet? The cast includes: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >outgoing, flamboyant Day Elves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >seductive, sultry Demonkin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >burly, disgruntled Orcs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and so much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not to mention, even in these fantasy worlds, comes a wide variety of flora and fauna at your disposal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Discover unique ingredients, whip up mouth watering dishes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a wide variety of ingredients, comes the scrumptious meals that you can make from them.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't remember how you were transported here, but this was your world now, your restaurant in another world, <strong>Isekai-ya</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dreams to become a chef took a strange turn, reality seemed to have warped before your eyes and what you see before you just seemed so odd. The buzz of unfamiliar languages, yet weirdly comprehensible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People of all shapes, colour and sizes; pointy ears and even fluffy warmth..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, in front of you, were unmistakably: A kitchen countertop, stoves, and shelves and larders stocked with colorful ingredients.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visit different worlds, meet the unique inhabitants</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who would you meet? The cast includes: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >outgoing, flamboyant Day Elves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >seductive, sultry Demonkin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >burly, disgruntled Orcs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and so much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not to mention, even in these fantasy worlds, comes a wide variety of flora and fauna at your disposal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Discover unique ingredients, whip up mouth watering dishes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a wide variety of ingredients, comes the scrumptious meals that you can make from them.</p>",
